事情還沒完 她會打來說她愛你

183
00:12:59,170 --> 00:13:02,370
Her feelings were so strong that it scared her.
她的感覺強烈到令她害怕

184
00:13:02,580 --> 00:13:07,070
Go home and wait for her call. She could call from the plane.
快回去等電話 她可能會從飛機上打

185
00:13:07,410 --> 00:13:11,680
But if she doesn't call, it is definitely over!
要是她沒打來， 那就是結束了

187
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:16,760
Unless,eventually,I call her to see what's going on...
除非最後我打給她探探口風

188
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:21,050
...and she says she'll call me back, but then she doesn't.
她說她會再打給我， 結果沒打

189
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:24,200
Then it's over!
那就真的結束了

190
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:26,390
Way to be strong!
真夠力

191
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:39,910
Can we watch cartoons on your TV?
我們可以在這裡看卡通嗎？ 

192
00:13:40,150 --> 00:13:42,450
We need a porn break.
我們需要休息一下

193
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:46,650
We spent two hours watching In and Out and In Again.
我們看了2小時的 「殺進殺出又殺進」

194
00:13:48,460 --> 00:13:50,480
Why don't you turn it off?
為什麼不關掉算了？ 

195
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:54,190
Then we'd be the guys who turned off free porn.
那我們會變成關掉A片的白癡

196
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:58,660
Yeah,but that's not what you'd go by.
別人又不會那樣叫你們

197
00:13:58,830 --> 00:14:01,730
Look,I'm going to have a kid someday. Okay?
瑞秋，將來我會有小孩

198
00:14:01,900 --> 00:14:05,600
And someday that kid is going to ask me if I ever turned off free porn.
他會問我有沒有關掉免費A片

199
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:08,700
I don't wanna have to tell him that I did.
我不想說我有

200
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:11,310
Did you ever asked you dad that?
你有問過你爸嗎？ 

201
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,610
I don't want to talk about it.
我拒談這件事

202
00:14:14,980 --> 00:14:16,970
Good,you're here!
太好了，你們都在

203
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,580
What you got there?
你手上拿什麼？ 

204
00:14:19,790 --> 00:14:22,650
This? I'm glad you asked.
這個？問得好

205
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:30,820
Don't you hate to cut a tin can with an ordinary steak knife?
用普通刀子切錫罐 不是很難切嗎？

206
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:36,170
I know what you're thinking.
我知道你們在想什麼

207
00:14:36,340 --> 00:14:38,170
Pregnant woman slays four?
「孕婦發狂砍殺四人」？

208
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:43,170
-Did they make you pay for those knives? -No.
你沒買下這些刀子吧？ 沒有

209
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:46,280
-Are you sure? -No.
你確定？ 沒有

210
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:50,240
You won't make enough money by selling knives.
賣刀賺不了多少錢的

211
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:54,620
I just need enough money for the second part of my plan.
我知道 我只需要後續計劃的本錢

212
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:57,090
-What's that? -My Saturn dealership.
後續計劃是什麼？ 經銷廢棄物處理設備

213
00:15:07,230 --> 00:15:08,760
Hello.

214
00:15:09,370 --> 00:15:12,460
-Ross. -Emily. Hi.
羅斯 艾蜜莉

215
00:15:14,710 --> 00:15:16,680
How was your flight?
旅途還順利嗎？ 

216
00:15:16,940 --> 00:15:18,170
It was dreadful.
很慘

217
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:22,820
It was terrible how I acted when you said those wonderful things.
你對我告白 我的反應卻那麼差勁

218
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:25,420
No,that's all right.
沒關係

219
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:29,120
I'm just glad you called.
我很高興你打來

220
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:32,950
Ross,there's something that I've got to tell you.
羅斯，我有事要告訴你

221
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:37,230
There's someone else.
我有男朋友了

222
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:45,830
Does that mean the same thing in England as it does in America?
這句話在英國的意思 跟在美國一樣嗎？

223
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:52,510
She doesn't know who she wants. Me or this "Colin" guy.
她不知道她想要誰 我還是那個柯林

224
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:56,580
So I told her when she figures it out, give me a call. Maybe I'll still be around.
我叫她想清楚再打給我 也許我還在

225
00:15:56,750 --> 00:16:01,410
When you say "still around," you mean still around like you might be in a relationship...
我問一下，你說也許還在 是你會等她選擇你

227
00:16:01,590 --> 00:16:05,920
...or still around like you might have died waiting for the phone to ring?
還是你會等電話等到死？

228
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:09,030
But it was so right.
原本明明很完美 

229
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:13,530
This isn't how it's supposed to go. There can't be another guy.
現在都亂了， 怎麼會有第三者

230
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:17,340
Of course,there's another guy!
當然有第三者

231
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:19,540
This is even more perfect.
這樣更完美

232
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:22,940
You have to prove your love!
現在你得證明你的愛

233
00:16:23,210 --> 00:16:27,080
I'm not proving anything. I'm done listening to you.
我什麼也不證明 我不會再聽你的了

234
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:29,550
If I hadn't let you talk me into this...
要不是被你說服跑去機場 

235
00:16:29,750 --> 00:16:32,450
...I wouldn't have put my fist through the wall.
我也不會搞到去槌牆

236
00:16:32,690 --> 00:16:34,240
You did that?
你槌牆？ 

237
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:36,790
I missed and hit the door.
結果沒打中打到門

238
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:40,160
But it opened really hard.
不過門彈得很用力

239
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:45,920
You have to go to London. You have to go fight for her.
你得去倫敦 什麼？ 你得去爭取她

241
00:16:46,130 --> 00:16:47,730
That makes sense.
對，有道理

242
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:51,060
You said you loved her, and she didn't say it back.
你說你愛她，她沒有回應 

243
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:55,730
Then she told you about another guy. Go to London. Scare her!
然後她打來說有男朋友 去倫敦吧，她會被嚇死

245
00:16:58,750 --> 00:17:00,980
When Rachel was with Paolo, what did you do?
瑞秋跟保羅在一起時 你做了什麼？

246
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:03,170
I made fun of his accent.
我嘲笑他的口音

247
00:17:03,950 --> 00:17:07,510
You sat back and let him have her. You didn't fight.
你讓他輕鬆得手 你完全沒爭取，沒錯吧？

248
00:17:07,690 --> 00:17:11,720
I just told you, I made fun of him behind his back.
我說了，我私下取笑他的口音

249
00:17:11,890 --> 00:17:13,660
Oh,I see.
我懂了

250
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:16,690
-You want that to happen with Emily? -No.
你想讓艾蜜莉也被搶走？ 不想

251
00:17:16,860 --> 00:17:19,770
All right then,go fight for her!
好，那就去爭取她

252
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:25,440
It's like a snake pit.
好像一窩蛇喔

253
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:28,430
That could be you and Emily.
你和艾蜜莉也可以那樣

254
00:17:31,350 --> 00:17:33,340
That but nicer.
比他們唯美

255
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:35,310
Go to London!
飛去倫敦 

256
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:37,270
Really?
真的？

257
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:42,050
Surprise her. Don't let her go without a fight.
快點，到她家門口， 給她驚喜 別把她拱手讓人

258
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:46,120
All right. I'm going to do it.
好，就這麼決定 

259
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:49,780
I'm going to London, and I'll fight for her.
我要去倫敦爭取她

260
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,620
Okay. Good luck!
好，加油

261
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:58,170
Can you pick me up one of those Toblerone bars at the airport?
羅斯，你到了機場 能不能幫我買特大三角巧克力

262
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:09,610
I did it! I figured out a way to make money.
我想到了！ 我想到賺錢的路子了

263
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:12,790
I'll open a massage place. Frank will help me.
我要開按摩院，找法蘭克幫忙

264
00:18:12,950 --> 00:18:17,220
We'll work it around his schedule, so he doesn't have to quit school.
配合他的時間，他就不必休學

265
00:18:19,190 --> 00:18:21,060
But how can you afford it?
好主意，但你哪來的錢？

266
00:18:21,330 --> 00:18:24,730
We were walking down the street, and we saw your van.
我們走在路上 看見你們辦外燴的小巴

267
00:18:24,970 --> 00:18:27,300
-And we realized -I'm telling it!
就想到… 我要說啦

268
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:33,540
People need transportation, and they need massages to relax.
人們需要交通工具 也需要按摩放鬆

269
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:38,370
We can combine the two. I give massages and Frank drives.
我們可以結合兩者 我按摩，法蘭克開車

270
00:18:38,650 --> 00:18:42,380
I'll bolt a table in the van, and you know what I've got?
我可以在小巴裡裝個桌子 結果就是什麼？

271
00:18:42,650 --> 00:18:45,550
A place that no one will get out of alive?
有進無出的死亡小巴？

272
00:18:46,850 --> 00:18:51,990
Think about it. It's a taxi that people take when they need to relax.
不是，你們想嘛 就是給想放鬆的人搭的計程車

273
00:18:52,230 --> 00:18:54,820
It's a Relaxi-Taxi!
叫做輕鬆任你行

274
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:58,290
The name was my favorite part!
我最想講的就是名字

275
00:18:59,230 --> 00:19:02,100
-I came up with it. -You did not!
是我想出來的 你亂講

276
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:09,200
You came up with Relaxi-Cab. That's not good.
你想的是輕鬆之行 一點也不好

277
00:19:14,410 --> 00:19:17,940
Oh,my god! Are you in England? Was Emily surprised?
天哪！你在英國嗎？ 艾蜜莉驚喜嗎？

278
00:19:18,150 --> 00:19:20,180
No,she hasn't come home yet.
不，因為她還沒回家

279
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:25,050
She hasn't been home all night. She must be with the other guy.
她整晚都沒回家 顯然是跟另一個人在一起

280
00:19:25,290 --> 00:19:29,020
I'm the stupid moron who spent the night here.
我則是在這裡守夜的白癡

281
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:32,720
-What was that? -I just put my fist through another wall.
什麼聲音？ 我又槌牆了

282
00:19:32,900 --> 00:19:34,390
Tell the guys.
告訴錢德和喬伊

283
00:19:35,770 --> 00:19:37,860
When is the next flight out?
下一班飛機是幾點？ 

284
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:39,160
About four hours.
大約4小時後

285
00:19:39,340 --> 00:19:43,170
Stay there for a while. If she doesn't show up,come home.
再等一下 如果她還不出現就回來

286
00:19:43,340 --> 00:19:46,640
There's a girl at the restaurant that would be perfect for you.
我剛想到 我們餐廳有個女生很適合你

287
00:19:48,150 --> 00:19:50,210
Tell him about Relaxi-Taxi.
告訴他輕鬆任你行的事

288
00:19:50,420 --> 00:19:53,720
Ask him if he likes it better than Relaxi-Cab.
問他是不是比輕鬆之行好

289
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:59,020
It's not Relaxi-Cab. It's Relaxi-Cab. Like Taxi-Cab.
不是輕鬆之行，是輕鬆車行 就像計程車行

290
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:01,390
That is better.
這個比較好

291
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:07,360
Do you have any 8's?
你有8嗎？ 

292
00:20:07,530 --> 00:20:09,020
No.
沒有

293
00:20:19,850 --> 00:20:21,610
Are we in London?
這裡是倫敦嗎？

294
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:24,680
Why are you here? You can't be here.
你怎麼在這裡？你不能在這裡

295
00:20:24,850 --> 00:20:26,820
I've come to talk to Ross.
我有話要對羅斯說

296
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:31,750
What?
怎麼了？

297
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:36,450
Nothing.
沒事

298
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:38,460
I was going to call him
我本來想打給他… 

299
00:20:38,630 --> 00:20:41,600
You came to tell him you love him. I knew it!
你來說你愛他，我就知道

300
00:20:41,870 --> 00:20:44,060
I was right! I'm right,right?
我是對的！我是對的吧？

301
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:46,700
I'd rather talk to him.
我只想跟他談

302
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:51,980
I've been to his apartment and he's not there.
我去過他家，他不在

303
00:20:52,250 --> 00:20:55,980
I need to talk to him. Do you know where he is?
我得跟他談談 你們知道他在哪裡嗎？

304
00:21:05,830 --> 00:21:07,160
Ross,are you there?
羅斯，你在嗎？

305
00:21:10,660 --> 00:21:15,190
Ross,I don't know if you hear this, but I'll talk anyway.
我不曉得你聽不聽得見 不過我就說了

306
00:21:15,500 --> 00:21:18,560
I'm in the States with your sister and friends.
我在美國 跟你的妹妹朋友在一起

307
00:21:18,740 --> 00:21:21,000
It's all over with Colin.
我跟柯林分手了

308
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:25,410
I came here to tell you that and to tell you
我來告訴你這件事，還有…

309
00:21:25,650 --> 00:21:29,170
Yes,Joey,you can have all the chocolate you want.
喬伊，你想要巧克力就拿吧

310
00:21:32,150 --> 00:21:37,020
I came here to tell you that I love you.
我來告訴你…我愛你

311
00:21:38,060 --> 00:21:39,250
I love you too!
我也愛你 

312
00:21:39,530 --> 00:21:43,020
I'll call you right now from the phone booth.
我現在就打公共電話給你

313
00:21:43,260 --> 00:21:45,060
You can't hear me.
你聽不見

314
00:21:46,870 --> 00:21:49,270
I wish I knew if you'd heard me.
真想知道你聽不聽得見

315
00:21:49,470 --> 00:21:52,870
I suppose I've given my neighbors a good laugh.
我不是剛告白完 就是給了鄰居笑柄

316
00:21:53,110 --> 00:21:57,440
Mrs. Newman,if you're listening, bugger off. None of your business.
紐曼太太，如果你在聽 滾開，不關你的事

317
00:21:59,080 --> 00:22:01,810
There's not much chance you did hear that.
你八成聽不見 

318
00:22:02,120 --> 00:22:04,810
There's the call waiting...
而且有電話進來了

319
00:22:05,050 --> 00:22:07,820
...so I should go.
我得掛了…

320
00:22:07,990 --> 00:22:09,510
Oh,well.
就這樣

321
00:22:17,530 --> 00:22:19,620
Ross,I love you.
羅斯，我愛你

322
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,000
Thank you.
謝謝

323
00:22:37,320 --> 00:22:40,480
I was just at the bank. There was this really hot teller...
我剛才去銀行 有個很辣的行員

324
00:22:40,650 --> 00:22:44,720
...and she didn't ask me to do it with her in the vault.
她沒有找我去金庫嘿咻

325
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:47,120
Same thing happened to me.
我也是

326
00:22:47,430 --> 00:22:52,060
Pizza delivery girl comes over, gives me the pizza and leaves!
披薩外送小妹來 放下披薩收了錢就走了

327
00:22:52,300 --> 00:22:55,560
No "Nice apartment, bet the bedrooms are huge"?
沒說「你家好漂亮」 「臥房一定很大吧？」

328
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:57,670
Nothing!
完全沒有

329
00:22:58,840 --> 00:23:01,670
You know what? We have to turn off the porn.
你知道嗎？ 我們得把A片關掉 

330
00:23:02,410 --> 00:23:04,500
I think you're right.
你說得對

331
00:23:06,250 --> 00:23:07,240
Ready?
準備好了嗎？

332
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:09,740
One,two,three.
一，二，三

333
00:23:14,990 --> 00:23:16,150
That's kind of nice.
蠻好的

334
00:23:17,260 --> 00:23:19,090
That's kind of a relief.
有種解脫感 對

335
00:23:26,270 --> 00:23:28,260
You want to see if we still have it?
想不想看它還在不在？ 想

336
00:23:30,100 --> 00:23:32,700
-Free porn! -We have free porn!
免費A片！ 我們有免費A片！

337
00:23:42,050 --> 00:23:45,780
There's one,two and three.
總共一，二，三

338
00:23:46,220 --> 00:23:49,090
-Oh,my God. -That's so beautiful.
天哪 太美了

339
00:23:49,260 --> 00:23:51,190
-Oh,man. -I can't believe it.
我真不敢相信 

340
00:23:51,360 --> 00:23:52,550
I know.
是啊

341
00:23:52,860 --> 00:23:54,790
I like the middle one the best.
我最喜歡中間那個

342
00:23:57,200 --> 00:24:00,330
Don't worry, I won't let the other two know.
放心，我不會告訴另外兩個

343
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
